WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 4)

4
01:10.799 --> 01:11.799
Think you're tough, huh?

5
01:12.640 --> 01:13.640
Young Master!

6
01:15.400 --> 01:16.400
You coward!

7
01:16.519 --> 01:18.239
Fight me one-on-one if you've got the guts!

8
01:18.519 --> 01:19.920
Ganging up on someone is pathetic!

9
01:20.400 --> 01:21.400
Let him go!

10
01:21.680 --> 01:22.680
One-on-one? Let's go!

11
01:25.599 --> 01:26.599
Young Master!

12
01:30.760 --> 01:31.760
Boss P'Eng!

13
01:31.959 --> 01:32.959
Stop fighting!

14
01:33.079 --> 01:34.079
Everyone, stand down!

15
01:40.159 --> 01:41.200
Please let him go.

16
01:43.400 --> 01:44.400
I'll go with you.

17
01:45.239 --> 01:46.680
I'll take full responsibility.

18
01:52.159 --> 01:52.959
You can't go with him!

19
01:52.959 --> 01:53.959
You still have your brother and sister to look after!

20
01:53.960 --> 01:55.160
Are you alright, Young Master?

21
02:00.840 --> 02:02.319
My mom texted me.

22
02:03.840 --> 02:05.239
She took the ring.

23
02:05.879 --> 02:07.959
Your mother admitted it?

24
02:16.240 --> 02:17.240
I'll go with you.

25
02:18.800 --> 02:20.240
I'll take full responsibility.

26
02:20.520 --> 02:21.039
No!

27
02:21.240 --> 02:22.240
You can't go with him.

28
02:22.319 --> 02:22.639
You...

29
02:23.000 --> 02:24.158
You really can't go with him!

30
02:24.159 --> 02:25.159
Boss P'Eng,

31
02:25.599 --> 02:27.400
we were just messing around the other day.

32
02:27.560 --> 02:29.159
He's my best friend from college.

33
02:29.680 --> 02:31.895
Even though there are some misunderstandings between us,

34
02:31.919 --> 02:33.479
could you please let it slide,

35
02:33.879 --> 02:34.999
just this once, for my sake?

36
02:41.039 --> 02:42.039
Fine.

37
02:42.159 --> 02:43.399
I'll do this as a favor to you.

38
02:43.840 --> 02:44.840
Thank you, Boss P'Eng.

39
02:45.159 --> 02:46.159
Mm.

40
02:47.319 --> 02:48.319
A Pong,

41
02:49.120 --> 02:50.158
please do me a favor.

42
02:50.159 --> 02:51.799
Go look after Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

43
02:51.800 --> 02:53.240
Just tell them...

44
02:54.439 --> 02:56.399
Tell them their big brother got a well-paying job

45
02:58.439 --> 02:59.960
and has to go out of town for a while.

46
03:00.759 --> 03:02.359
Tell them to be good.

47
03:02.360 --> 03:03.680
I'll be back as soon as I can,

48
03:04.080 --> 03:06.520
and I'll take them to the amusement park when I get back.

49
03:09.800 --> 03:11.439
I promise I'll be back soon.

50
03:16.639 --> 03:18.639
I'm sorry, Boss.

51
03:20.159 --> 03:21.919
I need to take an extended leave of absence.

52
03:23.599 --> 03:24.599
Right.

53
03:26.639 --> 03:27.639
A Pong,

54
03:27.800 --> 03:29.439
there are buns I made in the fridge.

55
03:30.000 --> 03:31.439
That should last you guys a while.

56
03:41.159 --> 03:42.159
Let's go.

57
03:47.759 --> 03:48.759
Don't worry about me.

58
03:50.120 --> 03:51.320
I'll come back safe and sound.

59
04:07.479 --> 04:08.000
Boss,

60
04:08.080 --> 04:09.080
Yes?

61
04:09.120 --> 04:10.400
All the bills here,

62
04:10.479 --> 04:12.199
plus any damages, are on me.

63
04:13.280 --> 04:15.240
I'll have Mingkun settle it with you in a moment.

64
04:15.319 --> 04:16.560
Understood.

65
04:20.480 --> 04:22.000
Since Milan is letting it slide,

66
04:22.439 --> 04:23.959
I won't waste my breath on you either.

67
04:30.120 --> 04:31.120
Young man,

68
04:31.839 --> 04:33.120
don't get too arrogant...

69
04:35.600 --> 04:38.480
until you have the leverage to back it up.

70
04:43.879 --> 04:44.879
Mr. Milan,

71
04:45.240 --> 04:46.040
I have other business,

72
04:46.199 --> 04:47.199
so I'll be heading back.

73
04:47.720 --> 04:48.720
If you need anything,

74
04:48.839 --> 04:50.000
just contact me directly.

75
04:50.800 --> 04:52.079
Of course. Take care.

76
04:52.680 --> 04:54.520
Thank you for showing mercy today, Boss P'Eng.

77
05:06.639 --> 05:07.639
Don't go after him.

78
05:08.240 --> 05:09.240
Let him go.

79
05:09.800 --> 05:10.800
Trust me.

80
05:11.519 --> 05:13.600
Boss P'Eng isn't a bad person deep down.

81
05:13.920 --> 05:15.318
He won't hurt your friend.

82
05:15.319 --> 05:16.319
Mm.

83
05:21.040 --> 05:22.040
Mm.

84
05:29.800 --> 05:32.879
You claimed you could work for me to pay off the debt.

85
05:35.839 --> 05:36.839
Let's hear the details.

86
05:38.040 --> 05:39.040
What should I say?

87
05:40.600 --> 05:41.759
Be specific.

88
05:42.600 --> 05:45.040
Like how exactly do you plan to pay it off?

89
05:49.279 --> 05:50.360
I can do housework,

90
05:51.480 --> 05:52.480
cook,

91
05:53.319 --> 05:54.399
and tend to the flowerbeds.

92
05:54.759 --> 05:56.160
I can do all of that.

93
05:56.519 --> 05:57.519
That's it?

94
06:02.120 --> 06:03.120
Yeah.

95
06:04.600 --> 06:05.759
Do you have any idea

96
06:06.000 --> 06:08.639
how much the diamond ring your mother stole is worth?

97
06:12.079 --> 06:13.639
The price tag would scare you to death.

98
06:14.480 --> 06:17.160
It might be an amount you couldn't pay off in your entire lifetime.

99
06:22.560 --> 06:23.920
Putting that aside,

100
06:25.000 --> 06:27.480
you claim you can clean and cook.

101
06:28.680 --> 06:31.000
I have professional maids and chefs at home.

102
06:31.720 --> 06:32.800
At best,

103
06:33.560 --> 06:35.920
you'd just tend to that flowerbed your mother looked after.

104
06:38.839 --> 06:41.959
Do you really think that's enough to clear your debt?

105
06:46.319 --> 06:47.759
Then what do you want?

106
06:48.319 --> 06:49.319
What I want?

107
06:56.240 --> 06:59.600
Shouldn't you know best what I want, deep down in your heart?

108
07:01.839 --> 07:03.439
I'm not a mind reader.

109
07:03.720 --> 07:04.920
How on earth would I know?

110
07:14.040 --> 07:15.720
You agreed to come back with me.

111
07:17.399 --> 07:18.639
I thought

112
07:20.680 --> 07:22.520
you were already prepared for what that meant.

113
07:30.240 --> 07:31.240
What?

114
07:31.399 --> 07:33.480
Still playing dumb with me?

115
07:36.319 --> 07:37.439
I'm not playing dumb.

116
07:38.000 --> 07:39.040
I genuinely don't know.

117
08:02.480 --> 08:03.199
Boss,

118
08:03.279 --> 08:04.279
please show some decency.

119
08:06.480 --> 08:07.560
Decency?

120
08:09.079 --> 08:11.879
That word doesn't exist in my dictionary.

121
08:14.160 --> 08:15.160
Besides,

122
08:16.040 --> 08:17.518
what right do you have

123
08:17.519 --> 08:18.879
to preach decency to me right now?

124
08:20.399 --> 08:21.800
I know where I stand.

125
08:22.240 --> 08:23.399
The things you're good at,

126
08:23.560 --> 08:24.560
I can't do.

127
08:25.160 --> 08:26.976
And what I'm good at, you wouldn't want to do.

128
08:27.000 --> 08:28.360
We both chose this.

129
08:38.559 --> 08:39.559
Go on.

130
08:40.720 --> 08:42.000
If you chose me,

131
08:42.759 --> 08:44.399
it means I, Pao Bei, am worth it.

132
08:44.799 --> 08:46.199
It's not about being worthy or not.

133
08:46.600 --> 08:47.879
If you think I'm not worth it,

134
08:48.320 --> 08:49.720
then turn me over to the police.

135
08:53.559 --> 08:54.600
Not bad.

136
08:59.200 --> 09:00.519
You've got some nerve, kid.

137
09:01.240 --> 09:02.720
You really do.

138
09:03.000 --> 09:04.000
Mm.

139
09:13.919 --> 09:16.200
Take care of this guy.

140
09:16.559 --> 09:17.559
Understood, Master.

141
09:17.759 --> 09:19.200
His room has been arranged.

142
09:19.360 --> 09:20.720
Your bath has been drawn as well.

143
09:21.159 --> 09:22.000
Please get some rest.

144
09:22.001 --> 09:23.159
I'll handle the rest.

145
09:37.600 --> 09:38.798
I told you,

146
09:38.799 --> 09:40.176
the roads around here are rough like this.

147
09:40.200 --> 09:41.840
I told you not to come, but you insisted.

148
09:43.679 --> 09:44.679
I just wanted to see

149
09:44.680 --> 09:46.200
where you and Pao Bei live.

150
09:50.120 --> 09:51.120
What is there to see?

151
09:52.039 --> 09:53.919
You're a big celebrity now.

152
09:54.799 --> 09:56.559
How could you possibly understand

153
09:57.120 --> 09:58.960
the struggles of working-class people like us?

154
10:01.360 --> 10:02.799
So what if I'm a star?

155
10:03.840 --> 10:05.080
Celebrities are human too.

156
10:11.159 --> 10:12.159
Come here.

157
10:12.639 --> 10:13.639
Huh?

158
10:25.919 --> 10:27.279
Look at our shadows on the wall.

159
10:28.600 --> 10:29.600
Aren't they the same?

160
11:17.200 --> 11:18.200
Want a smoke?

161
11:18.679 --> 11:19.679
No thanks.

162
11:20.440 --> 11:22.679
Smoking is bad for my voice and skin.

163
11:27.840 --> 11:29.079
I wonder who it was

164
11:29.080 --> 11:30.816
that taught others to smoke in the first place,

165
11:30.840 --> 11:32.000
only to quit first.

166
11:33.799 --> 11:35.399
I was young and dumb back then.

167
11:42.759 --> 11:43.759
What are you staring at?

168
11:48.200 --> 11:49.440
It feels like over the years,

169
11:49.919 --> 11:51.679
you and Pao Bei have had it pretty rough.

170
11:54.720 --> 11:55.720
And you haven't?

171
11:57.000 --> 11:58.000
Me?

172
11:58.480 --> 11:59.759
I've been alright.

173
12:01.360 --> 12:02.840
What's so hard about being a celebrity?

174
12:06.399 --> 12:07.399
Right.

175
12:07.960 --> 12:10.000
I mean, it can be tough,

176
12:10.480 --> 12:12.320
but at least I make more money than you guys.

177
12:13.480 --> 12:14.480
Fair point.

178
12:16.120 --> 12:17.120
So...

179
12:17.919 --> 12:20.879
how did you get those injuries from before?

180
12:32.440 --> 12:33.799
Training injuries.

181
12:37.799 --> 12:38.959
But that's all behind me now.

182
12:39.679 --> 12:40.080
Hey,

183
12:40.360 --> 12:41.559
you're something else.

184
12:42.080 --> 12:44.160
What made you think to smear soy sauce all over?

185
12:44.919 --> 12:46.359
If that really was Boss P'Eng,

186
12:46.360 --> 12:47.720
you'd be in serious trouble.

187
12:48.799 --> 12:49.879
So what if I would've been?

188
12:50.360 --> 12:51.399
I, Jiang Weibang,

189
12:51.559 --> 12:52.879
believe in an eye for an ear!

190
12:54.679 --> 12:56.639
My idioms might be a little rusty,

191
12:57.120 --> 13:00.279
but isn't it 'an eye for an eye'?

192
13:02.240 --> 13:03.559
So what if I'm uneducated?

193
13:03.600 --> 13:04.600
Got a problem with that?

194
13:05.399 --> 13:05.919
Not at all.

195
13:06.159 --> 13:07.159
Whatever works for you.

196
13:08.919 --> 13:13.519
What if that boss also believes in 'an eye for an ear'?

197
13:14.366 --> 13:16.840
Me, scared of him? Who have I ever been afraid of?

198
13:18.399 --> 13:20.360
Weren't you pretty scared of me back then?

199
13:22.159 --> 13:23.799
Scared of you? In your dreams!

200
13:24.399 --> 13:25.399
Hey,

201
13:25.559 --> 13:28.320
who was it that got hammered and cried about being afraid I'd leave?

202
13:28.720 --> 13:29.279
Hey!

203
13:29.679 --> 13:31.000
Don't talk nonsense!

204
13:31.240 --> 13:33.200
When did I ever say something that sappy?

205
13:33.360 --> 13:33.919
No way.

206
13:34.320 --> 13:35.320
Absolutely impossible!

207
13:38.823 --> 13:41.923
[A letter informing Milan that he has breached his contract and has to cooperate]

208
13:48.480 --> 13:49.480
What's wrong?

209
13:51.519 --> 13:52.480
In a bad mood?

210
13:52.481 --> 13:54.320
It's nothing, just work stuff.

211
13:54.919 --> 13:55.919
Let's hurry.

212
13:56.399 --> 13:57.959
Didn't Pao Bei ask you to take care of his siblings?

213
13:57.960 --> 13:58.960
Don't keep them waiting.

214
13:59.039 --> 14:00.039
Right.

215
14:24.399 --> 14:27.039
I've been on my feet all day without a single bite to eat.

216
14:58.360 --> 14:59.559
Whatever.

217
15:00.000 --> 15:01.880
You don't feel hungry when you're drunk anyway.

218
15:35.600 --> 15:36.879
Who is it?

219
15:52.000 --> 15:53.159
What's up?

220
15:53.559 --> 15:54.559
Finally come around?

221
15:56.159 --> 15:57.200
Let me in.

222
15:57.879 --> 15:59.360
I'm not done talking yet.

223
16:20.600 --> 16:21.600
Go ahead.

224
16:22.159 --> 16:24.159
What else do you have to add?

225
16:24.759 --> 16:26.399
The money my mom owes you,

226
16:27.200 --> 16:28.559
I will definitely pay you back.

227
16:30.039 --> 16:32.159
But please leave my friend A Pong alone,

228
16:32.519 --> 16:33.759
and my brother and sister too.

229
16:36.240 --> 16:38.799
Your friend brought this on himself.

230
16:39.960 --> 16:41.398
That and your mother owing me money

231
16:41.399 --> 16:42.799
are two entirely different things.

232
16:45.879 --> 16:46.879
Fine.

233
16:47.360 --> 16:49.360
Then could you please spare my brother and sister?

234
16:51.000 --> 16:53.360
Let them live and go to school in peace.

235
16:57.080 --> 16:59.279
No.

236
17:10.480 --> 17:12.400
What are you glaring at me for?

237
17:17.279 --> 17:18.400
Tell me.

238
17:19.880 --> 17:21.920
How do you plan to pay me back?

239
17:36.720 --> 17:38.160
I'm asking you.

240
17:38.559 --> 17:40.119
How will you pay me back?

241
17:42.599 --> 17:45.079
What do you even have?

242
17:52.200 --> 17:54.400
Even the clothes on your back

243
17:55.799 --> 17:57.440
belong to me.

244
18:09.440 --> 18:10.440
Face it.

245
18:10.839 --> 18:12.400
You have nothing.

246
18:13.039 --> 18:14.559
Just work it off here slowly

247
18:14.759 --> 18:16.279
and earn your keep,

248
18:17.319 --> 18:18.759
so that thief of a mother of yours...

249
18:18.920 --> 18:19.920
What did you say?

250
18:22.839 --> 18:23.759
What do I have?

251
18:23.799 --> 18:25.119
Tonight, I'll show you

252
18:26.759 --> 18:27.759
what I have.

253
19:10.319 --> 19:11.319
What's the matter?

254
19:12.440 --> 19:13.799
Don't even know how to kiss?

255
19:17.240 --> 19:19.400
Don't tell me it's your first time kissing a guy?

256
19:29.519 --> 19:31.279
Show me what you've got.

257
19:32.440 --> 19:33.920
Is this really all you have?

258
20:28.759 --> 20:30.000
What are you doing with that?

259
20:43.559 --> 20:44.559
Get out.

260
20:48.039 --> 20:49.039
Get out!

261
21:14.480 --> 21:15.480
Hey...

262
21:18.960 --> 21:20.480
What on earth am I doing?

263
21:23.359 --> 21:24.439
Still up this late?

264
21:24.440 --> 21:25.560
What are you doing out here?

265
21:29.039 --> 21:30.039
I...

266
21:30.359 --> 21:31.359
I got lost.

267
21:33.200 --> 21:34.239
Don't wander around at night.

268
21:34.240 --> 21:35.559
You might run into trouble.

269
21:36.160 --> 21:37.160
Come back with me.

270
21:40.480 --> 21:41.000
By the way,

271
21:41.359 --> 21:42.518
the Master instructed me

272
21:42.519 --> 21:43.599
to confiscate your phone.

273
21:44.640 --> 21:45.640
Why is he doing this?

274
21:47.480 --> 21:48.896
Don't I even have that much freedom?

275
21:48.920 --> 21:49.960
I'm just following orders.

276
21:50.000 --> 21:52.119
Or you could go in and ask him yourself.

277
21:58.440 --> 21:59.798
I'll hand it over once we're back in my room.

278
21:59.799 --> 22:00.799
Is that alright?

279
22:01.960 --> 22:03.799
Nothing happened just now, right?

280
22:06.960 --> 22:08.399
What could've happened to me?

281
22:08.400 --> 22:09.480
What are you talking about?

282
22:11.039 --> 22:12.039
Good.

283
22:12.200 --> 22:13.160
Because if something had happened,

284
22:13.161 --> 22:14.841
you wouldn't need to hand over your phone.

285
22:16.000 --> 22:16.960
What do you mean?

286
22:16.961 --> 22:18.761
Because you'd be allowed to leave right away.

287
22:21.640 --> 22:24.880
Then... does what just happened count?

288
22:41.279 --> 22:42.559
"Dear Xiaobei,"

289
22:43.079 --> 22:44.199
"Mom took"

290
22:44.200 --> 22:46.160
"a very expensive ring from my employer's house,"

291
22:46.960 --> 22:49.279
"so I have to go away for a while."

292
22:49.440 --> 22:51.200
"Take good care of your brother and sister."

293
22:51.240 --> 22:53.440
"If Master P'Eng from the employer's family finds you,"

294
22:53.680 --> 22:54.359
"remember:"

295
22:54.599 --> 22:56.440
"you must stay in his house at all costs."

296
22:56.759 --> 22:57.759
"No matter what."

297
22:58.680 --> 23:00.800
Is she offering me as collateral to pay off her debt?

298
23:01.119 --> 23:02.720
What kind of mother does that?

299
23:06.480 --> 23:09.119
Wait, something feels off.

300
23:09.720 --> 23:11.720
This doesn't sound like Mom's usual tone at all.

301
23:13.119 --> 23:14.720
Things are so urgent,

302
23:15.200 --> 23:17.680
yet she took the time to use perfect punctuation?

303
23:18.000 --> 23:19.119
That's really fishy.

304
23:19.359 --> 23:20.160
Don't worry.

305
23:20.161 --> 23:21.495
I'm only holding onto it temporarily.

306
23:21.519 --> 23:22.920
I won't snoop through your phone.

307
23:28.160 --> 23:30.119
Let me send one last text to A Pong,

308
23:30.440 --> 23:31.798
telling him not to worry about me

309
23:31.799 --> 23:33.295
and to look after my brother and sister.

310
23:33.319 --> 23:34.319
Alright.

311
23:34.920 --> 23:36.559
Do you need me to make a trip

312
23:36.839 --> 23:38.400
to grab some daily essentials for you?

313
23:39.920 --> 23:40.480
Oh, right.

314
23:40.481 --> 23:41.559
You can contact A Pong.

315
23:41.759 --> 23:43.000
He knows what I need.

316
23:43.680 --> 23:45.159
Have him pack things up

317
23:45.160 --> 23:46.319
and bring them over.

318
23:47.960 --> 23:48.480
Understood.

319
23:48.599 --> 23:49.599
I'll arrange it tomorrow.

320
23:55.839 --> 23:56.839
Mr. Mingkun,

321
23:58.720 --> 24:00.519
may I ask you something?

322
24:00.960 --> 24:02.119
Sure, go ahead.

323
24:04.319 --> 24:06.440
In Master P'Eng's room,

324
24:07.559 --> 24:09.119
there's an old,

325
24:09.400 --> 24:11.039
kind of ugly plushie.

326
24:11.200 --> 24:13.000
Is that thing really important to him?

327
24:13.200 --> 24:14.280
How do you know about that?

328
24:14.759 --> 24:16.920
Did the Master show it to you?

329
24:18.799 --> 24:19.400
No.

330
24:19.599 --> 24:21.680
I just caught a glimpse of it by accident.

331
24:21.720 --> 24:24.000
That's very precious to the Young Master.

332
24:25.160 --> 24:27.359
It was the last gift the Madame left for him.

333
24:29.079 --> 24:29.519
By the way,

334
24:29.759 --> 24:31.319
please be up early tomorrow.

335
24:32.440 --> 24:33.639
Master P'Eng asked

336
24:33.640 --> 24:35.759
that you prepare a Chinese breakfast for two.

337
24:42.079 --> 24:45.359
So the guy actually saved a portion for me.

338
24:45.680 --> 24:46.960
How thoughtful.

339
24:54.640 --> 24:55.960
So, what you're saying is

340
24:56.680 --> 24:59.118
you want me to let him go home?

341
24:59.119 --> 24:59.559
Yes.

342
25:00.000 --> 25:01.440
Exactly as Boss P'Eng understood.

343
25:04.000 --> 25:05.000
You see,

344
25:05.759 --> 25:07.720
these two kids are his younger siblings.

345
25:08.039 --> 25:09.318
They're still so young.

346
25:09.319 --> 25:12.142
Their parents are both gone, leaving them all alone. It's heartbreaking.

347
25:13.519 --> 25:14.799
Alright, I got it.

348
25:16.400 --> 25:17.400
Let's talk about you.

349
25:18.559 --> 25:19.559
Oh.

350
25:23.480 --> 25:24.240
Boss P'Eng,

351
25:24.359 --> 25:26.359
do you usually eat this for breakfast?

352
25:33.559 --> 25:35.880
So that's what he meant by 'breakfast for two.'

353
25:38.400 --> 25:39.400
No.

354
25:39.720 --> 25:40.920
It was made specially for you.

355
25:43.599 --> 25:46.599
Pao Bei got up at four in the morning to prepare all this.

356
25:47.920 --> 25:49.440
Thank you for your hard work, Pao Bei.

357
25:51.119 --> 25:52.960
I'm in for a treat today.

358
25:53.400 --> 25:55.320
Thank you for your warm hospitality, Boss P'Eng.

359
25:55.359 --> 25:57.559
It makes this foreign visitor feel right at home.

360
25:58.079 --> 25:59.480
A true celebrity.

361
25:59.920 --> 26:02.079
I could never match that eloquence and charm.

362
26:03.480 --> 26:04.480
Try some.

363
26:06.200 --> 26:07.599
This steamed bun looks great.

364
26:14.960 --> 26:15.960
What's the filling?

365
26:16.519 --> 26:18.839
It feels familiar yet new.

366
26:19.680 --> 26:20.680
The texture is wonderful.

367
26:21.960 --> 26:23.599
It's stuffed with cauliflower and tofu.

368
26:25.200 --> 26:26.439
It's my first time trying this.

369
26:26.440 --> 26:27.440
It's delicious.

370
26:30.680 --> 26:31.680
Boss P'Eng,

371
26:31.920 --> 26:33.680
why not let Pao Bei sit down and join us?

372
26:33.920 --> 26:34.920
He worked hard on this.

373
26:34.960 --> 26:35.960
No need.

374
26:36.559 --> 26:37.999
We have our own business to discuss.

375
26:39.920 --> 26:40.920
Dismiss everyone.

376
26:41.119 --> 26:42.119
Yes, sir.

377
26:45.279 --> 26:46.279
Hey, you.

378
26:46.720 --> 26:47.720
Wait.

379
26:52.640 --> 26:53.640
Give him his phone.

380
26:53.759 --> 26:54.759
Let him go home.

381
26:57.599 --> 27:00.200
"If Master P'Eng from the employer's family finds you,"

382
27:00.559 --> 27:01.240
"remember:"

383
27:01.241 --> 27:03.079
"you must stay in his house at all costs."

384
27:03.240 --> 27:04.240
"No matter what."

385
27:06.119 --> 27:07.119
I'm not leaving.

386
27:10.960 --> 27:11.960
Suit yourself.

387
27:16.920 --> 27:18.440
Where were we?

388
27:35.759 --> 27:37.200
Are you really letting him leave?

389
27:42.279 --> 27:43.519
He won't leave.

390
27:53.599 --> 27:54.599
"Give him his phone."

391
27:54.640 --> 27:55.640
"Let him go home."

392
27:57.119 --> 27:58.119
"I'm not leaving."

393
28:02.079 --> 28:03.079
"Suit yourself."

394
28:03.599 --> 28:05.640
What the hell does he mean by that?

395
28:06.000 --> 28:07.280
Just casting me aside like this?

396
28:07.400 --> 28:08.400
What do you take me for?

397
28:08.480 --> 28:09.480
Some kind of gigolo?

398
28:11.559 --> 28:12.799
Screw this, I'm done!

399
28:14.200 --> 28:15.520
Let someone else put up with him!

400
28:18.319 --> 28:20.159
Look at you, full of fire on an empty stomach.

401
28:23.079 --> 28:24.735
Your steamed buns are genuinely delicious.

402
28:24.759 --> 28:25.640
You've been busy all morning.

403
28:25.680 --> 28:26.680
Come have some too.

404
28:27.480 --> 28:28.480
I'm fine, not hungry.

405
28:34.480 --> 28:35.839
Full from anger, are we?

406
28:36.279 --> 28:37.640
What do you think he's playing at?

407
28:37.880 --> 28:39.039
What does he take me for?

408
28:39.279 --> 28:41.118
Who does he think he is, dismissing me like that?

409
28:41.119 --> 28:41.960
It was just a few kisses!

410
28:41.960 --> 28:42.960
What's the big deal?

411
28:50.519 --> 28:51.598
Wait, that's...

412
28:51.599 --> 28:52.959
Forget it, drop it.

413
28:52.960 --> 28:53.960
I get your point.

414
28:54.599 --> 28:57.119
So you're really not leaving?

415
28:58.440 --> 28:59.440
Hell no, I'm not leaving!

416
28:59.960 --> 29:01.200
I need an explanation from him!

417
29:01.839 --> 29:02.839
Mm.

418
29:02.920 --> 29:05.200
Though you might have to wait until tonight.

419
29:05.440 --> 29:07.079
You still have a day's work to do here.

420
29:07.400 --> 29:08.160
Huh?

421
29:08.160 --> 29:09.160
Is he going out?

422
29:09.319 --> 29:09.880
Yes.

423
29:10.240 --> 29:11.240
He's taking Milan out.

424
29:25.079 --> 29:26.278
What is his deal anyway?

425
29:26.279 --> 29:27.279
A grown man,

426
29:27.440 --> 29:29.360
does he always need someone keeping him company?

427
29:29.559 --> 29:31.440
One person yesterday, another today.

428
29:31.680 --> 29:32.960
Can't he just be alone for once?

429
30:32.079 --> 30:33.079
Young Master.

430
30:33.559 --> 30:34.039
Young Master.

431
30:34.040 --> 30:35.200
I'll take you to get changed.

432
30:36.039 --> 30:37.039
Young M...

433
30:38.920 --> 30:39.920
Don't walk away!

434
30:40.440 --> 30:41.640
You wait right here!

435
30:42.559 --> 30:44.400
Fine, Master P'Eng.

436
31:06.920 --> 31:07.920
Come in.

437
31:09.640 --> 31:10.359
Pao Bei,

438
31:10.519 --> 31:12.480
there are a few things I need to brief you on.

439
31:14.240 --> 31:15.039
Go ahead.

440
31:15.040 --> 31:17.200
You said you wanted to take on more work,

441
31:17.440 --> 31:18.758
but this place is huge.

442
31:18.759 --> 31:20.000
You can't handle it all alone.

443
31:20.599 --> 31:21.720
The Master instructed

444
31:21.880 --> 31:22.919
that you only need to clean

445
31:22.920 --> 31:24.640
the areas where he spends most of his time.

446
31:26.400 --> 31:27.519
What does that mean?

447
31:27.880 --> 31:30.440
He specifically ordered me to clean the places he frequents?

448
31:32.119 --> 31:32.480
Yes.

449
31:32.559 --> 31:34.880
He made a point to say that right before heading out.

450
31:37.880 --> 31:39.160
Didn't he just tell me to scram?

451
31:39.599 --> 31:40.719
Now he's pulling this stunt.

452
31:42.079 --> 31:43.279
I really can't figure him out.

453
31:44.400 --> 31:45.400
Neither can I.

454
31:50.559 --> 31:51.758
Mr. Mingkun,

455
31:51.759 --> 31:53.200
I really admire you.

456
31:54.839 --> 31:55.839
Admire me for what?

457
31:57.799 --> 31:59.399
Working for that monster...

458
31:59.400 --> 32:00.680
how long have you been with him?

459
32:02.119 --> 32:03.558
We grew up together,

460
32:03.559 --> 32:04.559
right up to now.

461
32:06.039 --> 32:07.799
Then honestly, I admire you even more.

462
32:08.319 --> 32:10.400
Haven't you ever thought about leaving

463
32:10.480 --> 32:11.919
to do what you actually want to do?

464
32:11.920 --> 32:14.078
Why don't we partner up on something?

465
32:14.079 --> 32:15.799
Let's not stay here and let him torture us!

466
32:17.799 --> 32:20.680
My parents and I have dedicated our lives to this family.

467
32:20.920 --> 32:22.359
I have no intention of leaving.

468
32:24.599 --> 32:25.879
That's such a shame.

469
32:25.880 --> 32:27.358
With your patience and resilience,

470
32:27.359 --> 32:29.399
you could succeed at anything you set your mind to.

471
32:30.680 --> 32:32.000
You're quite impressive yourself.

472
32:32.680 --> 32:34.598
You should know, those permitted by the Master

473
32:34.599 --> 32:36.359
to enter his room and clean

474
32:36.920 --> 32:37.920
are few and far between.

475
32:40.079 --> 32:43.319
Then who cleaned it before I got here?

476
32:48.279 --> 32:49.160
It was me.

477
32:49.160 --> 32:50.160
Right.

478
32:51.440 --> 32:53.239
So I should be thanking you

479
32:53.240 --> 32:54.720
for taking so much work off my hands.

480
32:56.160 --> 32:57.160
Keep it up.

481
32:57.359 --> 32:58.679
I have other things to attend to.

482
33:01.440 --> 33:02.039
Alright.

483
33:02.240 --> 33:03.279
Leave it to me!

484
33:06.000 --> 33:07.400
I need to learn from Mingkun,

485
33:07.559 --> 33:09.119
learn to adapt and endure.

486
33:09.720 --> 33:10.720
I definitely can't leave.

487
33:11.440 --> 33:12.960
I can't let him get his way so easily.

488
33:13.920 --> 33:16.160
Besides, didn't Mom tell me to stay here no matter what?

489
33:16.720 --> 33:19.039
She must have had a reason.

490
33:19.960 --> 33:22.599
Could it be related to that secret room?

491
33:23.400 --> 33:25.840
Given the chance, I'm definitely sneaking in to check it out.

492
33:25.960 --> 33:27.359
If I find dirt on that monster,

493
33:28.079 --> 33:29.880
he won't dare bully me ever again.

494
33:48.680 --> 33:49.680
What's this?

495
34:05.119 --> 34:08.159
Technology really does make life easier, huh?

496
34:08.679 --> 34:10.000
This thing is so convenient!

497
34:34.639 --> 34:35.639
Ow, that hurts!

498
34:36.920 --> 34:38.280
What did I do to deserve this?

499
34:39.320 --> 34:40.760
This room is definitely cursed.

500
34:41.519 --> 34:43.639
I'm getting out of here as soon as I finish sweeping.

501
34:50.079 --> 34:51.079
It broke!

502
35:04.000 --> 35:05.079
Don't panic.

503
35:08.159 --> 35:09.159
Glue.

504
35:09.519 --> 35:10.519
Find some glue.

505
35:30.960 --> 35:32.279
"That's something"

506
35:32.280 --> 35:33.720
"very precious to the Young Master."

507
35:34.400 --> 35:36.480
"It was the last gift the Madame left for him."

508
35:50.320 --> 35:51.320
Listen carefully:

509
35:51.679 --> 35:53.639
Only the Young Master is allowed in this room.

510
35:54.199 --> 35:56.320
Anyone else who enters without permission

511
35:56.599 --> 35:58.320
will face severe consequences.

512
35:59.440 --> 36:02.799
The key to that secret room must be in here.

513
36:02.800 --> 36:04.079
Just you wait.

514
36:04.159 --> 36:05.719
One day, I'll uncover all your secrets.

515
36:08.360 --> 36:10.199
Glue...

516
36:10.400 --> 36:11.400
There's no time.

517
36:11.480 --> 36:12.520
I have to find glue first.

518
36:49.079 --> 36:51.199
Why did the two of them come back together?

519
36:51.519 --> 36:52.519
Don't tell me they...

520
36:52.960 --> 36:53.960
they...

521
36:54.360 --> 36:55.639
What a shameless playboy!

522
37:04.559 --> 37:05.639
Pao Bei.

523
37:05.960 --> 37:06.960
Pao Bei!

524
37:09.000 --> 37:09.800
Pao Bei!

525
37:09.920 --> 37:12.639
The Master wants you to go to his room.

526
37:13.039 --> 37:14.119
What does he want now?

527
37:14.599 --> 37:16.760
Didn't he bring someone home already?

528
37:17.599 --> 37:18.639
Looking for trouble again.

529
37:21.599 --> 37:22.639
Just my luck.

530
37:38.679 --> 37:39.760
What do you want?

531
37:41.320 --> 37:42.519
Did he find out?

532
37:42.920 --> 37:44.119
Probably not.

533
37:44.400 --> 37:45.558
I glued it back so securely.

534
37:45.559 --> 37:46.999
I tugged on it over and over, and it didn't budge.

535
37:47.000 --> 37:48.119
There's no way he noticed.

536
37:48.960 --> 37:50.079
Right, impossible.

537
37:50.400 --> 37:51.800
I shouldn't psych myself out.

538
37:52.119 --> 37:53.239
You call me over

539
37:53.320 --> 37:54.615
and don't say a word. What's the deal?

540
37:54.639 --> 37:56.079
Who gave you permission to touch it?

541
37:59.760 --> 38:00.760
Touch what?

542
38:02.159 --> 38:03.480
Did you touch this?

543
38:07.119 --> 38:08.119
Yeah, I did.

544
38:15.719 --> 38:17.239
Get your revenge if you must.

545
38:17.440 --> 38:18.960
First you spilled water,

546
38:19.559 --> 38:20.800
and now you broke my stuff?

547
38:21.880 --> 38:22.800
Broke it? I—.

548
38:22.801 --> 38:24.000
Still denying it?

549
38:26.880 --> 38:27.880
Do you take me for an idiot?

550
38:27.881 --> 38:30.041
You think I can't tell right-side up from upside down?

551
38:34.840 --> 38:36.600
How was I supposed to know which way was up?

552
38:40.960 --> 38:41.800
The spilled water,

553
38:41.960 --> 38:43.000
I let that slide.

554
38:43.519 --> 38:45.079
And now you break my belongings?

555
38:46.280 --> 38:47.360
I didn't do it on purpose!

556
38:47.880 --> 38:49.439
I just wanted to glue it back together!

557
38:49.440 --> 38:50.760
Can't tell which way is up, huh?

558
38:52.159 --> 38:53.159
Fine.

559
38:54.079 --> 38:55.079
Let me teach you.

560
38:56.719 --> 38:57.719
What are you doing?

561
38:58.199 --> 38:58.920
Let go of me!

562
38:58.960 --> 38:59.599
What do you want?

563
38:59.599 --> 39:00.599
Let go of me!

564
39:00.679 --> 39:01.679
Put me down!

565
39:01.960 --> 39:02.960
Mingkun, help me!

566
39:03.039 --> 39:04.400
Your master has gone crazy again!

567
39:04.519 --> 39:05.280
Mingkun, save me!

568
39:05.440 --> 39:06.800
Mingkun, help me!

569
39:07.760 --> 39:08.760
Mingkun!

570
39:11.079 --> 39:12.119
Let go of me!

571
39:18.480 --> 39:19.480
What is your problem?

572
39:23.360 --> 39:24.039
If you want to play around,

573
39:24.040 --> 39:25.360
couldn't you be a little gentler?

574
39:44.079 --> 39:45.079
Scared now?

575
39:45.920 --> 39:47.000
Dare to mess with me again?

576
39:47.199 --> 39:48.320
I'm not scared of you!

577
39:48.519 --> 39:49.760
I'm not afraid of you at all!

578
39:54.199 --> 39:55.238
Call me daddy.

579
39:55.239 --> 39:56.639
Call me daddy and I'll forgive you.

580
40:00.719 --> 40:01.719
What are you laughing at?

581
40:04.639 --> 40:07.320
I'm laughing at how childish you are.

582
40:08.719 --> 40:09.800
What did you say?

583
40:11.920 --> 40:15.320
Only a little kid would ask someone to call him daddy.

584
40:25.840 --> 40:26.840
Keep going!

585
40:26.960 --> 40:28.000
Why did you stop?

586
40:28.559 --> 40:29.679
Is that all you've got?
